#: src/plugins/cloud/gaudit-cloud.c:471
msgid ""
"--vfs-cache-mode full keeps a copy of what is used on this computer, and --"
"dir-cache-time remembers the lists of files for an hour: without them, Files "
"fetches every file to show the folder, which can take minutes. --umask 077 "
"shows what is there as yours alone, as it is: other accounts cannot reach a "
"mount like this. --daemon lets it run in the background until you log out. "
"To mount it each time you log in, rclone's own documentation shows how."
msgstr ""

#: src/plugins/cloud/gaudit-cloud.c:485
#, c-format
msgid ""
"The account is then two disks. %s is private: what you put there is "
"encrypted before it leaves the computer, and the key is never shared. %s is "
"shareable: the account as it was, without the encrypted folder. The provider "
"can read what is there, it can be shared with others, and what others share "
"with you shows there."
msgstr ""

#: src/plugins/cloud/gaudit-cloud.c:495
#, c-format
msgid ""
"%s is shareable: the account as it is, without the encrypted folder. The "
